        (case "ram::tests::metadata_lifecycle::metadata_custody::detached_opened_inventory_retains_origin_credit_after_outer_owner_close" "adversarial" ["RAM-12" "STORE-4"] "Actual admitted open permits public record and topology clones to outlive its facade; the same finite namespace loan remains through the last shared inventory clone. Newly cloned root vectors remain caller-funded; no native authority is issued.")
